          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He smiles like a knife sliding home.* Wise. Tell the miller his son serves a greater wheel now -- one that grinds finer than his ever did."
          }
        }
      },
      {
